---
---
<section class="section" id="pathway">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">05 · Development Pathway</span>
      <h2>From design artifact to shared scientific tool.</h2>
      <p>
        Every agent travels a defined path. Teams first design through CARE, then
        build and benchmark in AKD Labs, pass an SME-led readiness review, and only
        then publish approved agents to AKD Flow and the public GitHub.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="pipeline" aria-label="Agent development pipeline">
      <div class="pipe-step">
        <div class="icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M3 4h13l5 5v11H3z"/><path d="M3 11h18"/></svg>
        </div>
        <span>Phase 1</span>
        <b>CARE Design</b>
      </div>
      <div class="pipe-step">
        <div class="icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M9 19V5l11 7z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <span>Phase 2</span>
        <b>Build &amp; Benchmark in AKD Labs</b>
      </div>
      <div class="pipe-step">
        <div class="icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/></svg>
        </div>
        <span>Phase 3</span>
        <b>SME Review Gate</b>
      </div>
      <div class="pipe-step">
        <div class="icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M5 21V8l7-5 7 5v13"/><path d="M9 21v-7h6v7"/></svg>
        </div>
        <span>Phase 4</span>
        <b>Publish to AKD Flow</b>
      </div>
      <div class="pipe-step">
        <div class="icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M2 12h20M12 2a15 15 0 010 20M12 2a15 15 0 000 20"/></svg>
        </div>
        <span>Phase 5</span>
        <b>Share with Science Users</b>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .pipeline {
    margin-top: 24px;
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
    gap: 12px;
    align-items: stretch;
  }
  .pipe-step {
    position: relative;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: 22px 18px;
    background: var(--bg-0);
    box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.04), 0 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.04);
    text-align: left;
  }
  .pipe-step .icon {
    width: 34px; height: 34px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    background: var(--surface);
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: 14px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
  }
  .pipe-step b {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 17px;
    display: block;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .pipe-step span {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .pipe-step::after {
    content: "→";
    position: absolute;
    right: -14px;
    top: 50%;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 16px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    z-index: 2;
  }
  .pipe-step:last-child::after { content: ""; }

  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .pipeline { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
    .pipe-step::after { content: ""; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .pipeline { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
